egory":"移动","seq":null,"text":"当一切归于寂静，我们的故事才会重新开始。","hasText":true,"duration":6.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1386/0612266F3C9AA1000183132343730383333.mp3"},{"id":"0686266F3C9AA1000183137373134383235","heroId":"1386","skinId":"1387","skinName":"黯羽东君","title":"移动语音9","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"云梦泽，是个没有冬天的地方。","hasText":true,"duration":6.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1386/0686266F3C9AA1000183137373134383235.mp3"},{"id":"0603866F3C9AB1000183137333937353734","heroId":"1386","skinId":"1387","skinName":"黯羽东君","title":"挑衅1","category":"挑衅","seq":null,"text":"一到下雨天，就冒出来这么多嗡嗡叫的虫子！","hasText":true,"duration":5.6,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1386/0603866F3C9AB1000183137333937353734.mp3"},{"id":"0652566F3C9AB1000183732333038383636","heroId":"1386","skinId":"1387","skinName":"黯羽东君","title":"移动语音12","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"巨木下的祷告，和天穹上的呻吟，同样吵闹。","hasText":true,"duration":7.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1386/0652566F3C9AB1000183732333038383636.mp3"},{"id":"0614666F3C9A81000183631333638313838","heroId":"1386","skinId":"1387","skinName":"黯羽东君","title":"移动语音4","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"九神巫当然是天选之人啦~天选的替死鬼罢了。","hasText":true,"duration":6.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1386/0614666F3C9A81000183631333638313838.mp3"},{"id":"0656266F3C9A91000183831383932323538","heroId":"1386","skinId":"1387","skinName":"黯羽东君","title":"移动语音6","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"生命，凋亡在天穹的裂隙中，多么绚烂！","hasText":true,"duration":6.1,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1386/0656266F3C9A91000183831383932323538.mp3"},{"id":"0665866F3C9A81000183631363936373933","heroId":"1386","skinId":"1387","skinName":"黯羽东君","title":"移动语音3","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"多美的天穹！我已经迫不及待想要亲手戳破它了~","hasText":true,"duration":7.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1386/0665866F3C9A81000183631363936373933.mp3"},{"id":"0627266F3C9A91000183437343630393737","heroId":"1386","skinId":"1387","skinName":"黯羽东君","title":"移动语音7","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"怕黑吗？我可以假扮光明战神“东君”，嘻嘻~","hasText":true,"duration":8.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1386/0627266F3C9A91000183437343630393737.mp3"},{"id":"0618966F3C9A91000183635383839323338","heroId":"1386","skinId":"1387","skinName":"黯羽东君","title":"移动语音5","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"太阳？一整个——都被我吞掉啦！","hasText":true,"duration":6.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1386/0618966F3C9A91000183635383839323338.mp3"},{"id":"0679166F3C9A81000183135393638353836","heroId":"1386","skinId":"1387","skinName":"黯羽东君","title":"移动语音1","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"我不是闲人，是坏人哟~","hasText":true,"duration":5.5,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1386/0679166F3C9A81000183135393638353836.mp3"},{"id":"0665866F3C9A71000183939343033343531","heroId":"1386","skinId":"1387","skinName":"黯羽东君","title":"大厅语音3","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"神巫的祭典早已结束，自由的暗影泽被森林！","hasText":true,"duration":11.2,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1386/0665866F3C9A71000183939343033343531.mp3"},{"id":"0604666F3C9A81000183133373032343136","heroId":"1386","skinId":"1387","skinName":"黯羽东君","title":"移动语音2","category":"移动","seq":null,"text":"云梦泽啊，光明灌溉的土地，暗影怒放的舞台！","hasText":true,"duration":7.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1386/0604666F3C9A81000183133373032343136.mp3"},{"id":"0675766F3C9A71000183831323537393630","heroId":"1386","skinId":"1387","skinName":"黯羽东君","title":"大厅语音2","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"在奇迹的废墟之上，我将重建秩序的蓝图~","hasText":true,"duration":8.4,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1386/0675766F3C9A71000183831323537393630.mp3"},{"id":"0676966F3C9A61000183135333633343239","heroId":"1386","skinId":"1387","skinName":"黯羽东君","title":"大厅语音1","category":"大厅","seq":null,"text":"光明与暗影，交织命运的织锦。","hasText":true,"duration":12.3,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1386/0676966F3C9A61000183135333633343239.mp3"},{"id":"0649369BA514C1000183138333134313436","heroId":"1386","skinId":"1725","skinName":"百相守梦","title":"影_百相守梦_皮肤主题音乐","category":"背景音乐","seq":null,"text":"皮肤主题音乐","hasText":true,"duration":188.8,"audio":"https://audio.wzry.panini-pigs.cn/audio/1386/0649369BA514C1000183138333134313436.mp3"}]